<title>TURKEY: Turkish 182-d t-bill yield jumps to 144.92 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkish 182-d t-bill yield jumps to 144.92 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 182-day t-bill yield jumped to 144.92 pct on Tuesday, up 9.76 points from the previous 182-day auction on November 12.</p>
<p>	Maturity		    : May 21, 1997</p>
<p>	Amount			: 51.49 trln lira</p>
<p>	Coupon			: -</p>
<p>	Minimum yield	     : -</p>
<p>	Maximum yield	     : 144.92</p>
<p>	Average yield	     : -</p>
<p>	Bid amount/cover	  : 154.3 trln</p>
<p>	Lowest accepted price   : 63,898 lira</p>
<p>Pct allocated at lowest price : -</p>
<p>	Payment date		: November 20, 1996</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
